{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "rag-slo",
  "title": "RAG SLO",
  "tags": [
    "rag",
    "slo"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "請求率（依 response_source）",
      "description": "Chat stream requests per second, all outcomes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (response_source) (rate(chat_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{response_source}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "可用性（所選時間範圍）",
      "description": "successes / (successes + errors) over the selected time range, all response sources.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "No data",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.99
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.995
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(chat_requests_total{outcome=\"success\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(chat_requests_total{outcome=~\"success|error\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "availability",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "28 天 error budget 剩餘",
      "description": "1 = whole budget left, 0 = used up, negative = overspent. Uses increase(...[28d]); with less than 28 days of data it is the cumulative figure since measuring began.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "No data",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.25
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "1 - ((1 - sum(increase(chat_requests_total{outcome=\"success\"}[28d])) / sum(increase(chat_requests_total{outcome=~\"success|error\"}[28d]))) / (1 - slo:chat_availability:target))",
          "legendFormat": "budget remaining",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "說明",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Reading this dashboard**\n\n- Availability is successes / (successes + errors) across every `response_source`, including `unknown`; `cancelled` requests are not counted.\n- Latency panels cover the `rag` path only. First-answer time is the first `delta` event (the output guardrail buffers the whole answer first), not the first event of any kind.\n- **Error budget remaining** uses `increase(...[28d])`. With less than 28 days of data it is the cumulative figure since measuring began, not a full 28-day window. It reads the `slo:chat_availability:target` recording rule.\n- **SLO attainment** panels read recording rules (`slo:*`) and stay empty until those rules exist in `monitoring/prometheus/rules/slo.yml`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "rag 首段回答延遲 P50 / P95",
      "description": "Time from stream start to the first delta event, successful rag requests only.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(chat_first_answer_text_seconds_bucket{response_source=\"rag\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(chat_first_answer_text_seconds_bucket{response_source=\"rag\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "rag 完整回應延遲 P50 / P95",
      "description": "Time from stream start to the done event, successful rag requests only.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(chat_response_duration_seconds_bucket{response_source=\"rag\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(chat_response_duration_seconds_bucket{response_source=\"rag\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "SLO 達成比例（recording rules）",
      "description": "Reads recording rules; empty until they are defined in monitoring/prometheus/rules/slo.yml.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "slo:chat_availability:ratio_rate5m",
          "legendFormat": "availability",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "slo:rag_first_answer_text_good:ratio_rate5m",
          "legendFormat": "rag first answer text within threshold",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "slo:rag_response_duration_good:ratio_rate5m",
          "legendFormat": "rag response duration within threshold",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "低信心比例（所選時間範圍）",
      "description": "Share of retrievals that ended below the grading threshold. Depends on the question mix.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "No data",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.25
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(rag_retrieval_total{low_confidence=\"true\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(rag_retrieval_total[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "low confidence",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "檢索重試率",
      "description": "Retrieval retries performed per retrieval, 5 minute rate.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rag_retrieval_retries_total[5m])) / sum(rate(rag_retrieval_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "retries per retrieval",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "重排延遲 P95",
      "description": "Duration of successful rerank attempts only (outcome=ok); timeouts and errors are counted in the degradation panel.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(rag_rerank_duration_seconds_bucket{outcome=\"ok\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "重排降級率",
      "description": "Share of rerank attempts that timed out or failed and fell back to the fused order.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 35,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rag_rerank_duration_seconds_count{outcome!=\"ok\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(rag_rerank_duration_seconds_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "degraded",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
